## Original Content
अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रंप ने होर्मुज जलडमरूमध्य से सभी बारूदी सुरंगों को हटाने या नष्ट करने का दावा किया है. उन्होंने ईरान को चेतावनी दी है कि यदि कोई नई सुरंगें बिछाता है तो उसे तुरंत नष्ट कर दिया जाएगा.

## Summary
US President Donald Trump claimed that all mines have been cleared from the Strait of Hormuz. He warned Iran that any new mines laid will be immediately destroyed, emphasizing a strong stance on regional security.

## Key Points
- Trump claimed all mines have been cleared from the Strait of Hormuz.
- Iran was warned against laying new mines in the area.
- Any new mines will be destroyed immediately if laid.


